WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,470
Her medical skills are as good as copper, but her nature is still kind.

2
00:00:03,470 --> 00:00:08,150
It's a pity that I'm extremely desperate and can never let outsiders into Baolei rashly.

3
00:00:08,150 --> 00:00:12,670
Just hang on to the deal first, and you won’t have to worry about finding a reliable doctor later.

4
00:00:12,670 --> 00:00:18,810
If you want to exchange, take out the chips that can impress me

5
00:00:18,810 --> 00:00:22,890
Can it be counted as a prepaid medical fee? I can't bear it anymore.

6
00:00:22,890 --> 00:00:26,250
I can give you food and medicine, but I need you to do one thing for me

7
00:00:26,250 --> 00:00:32,090
The entire building will definitely attack me. If you find out the specific attack plan and manpower deployment, let me know as soon as possible.

8
00:00:36,110 --> 00:00:38,390
This house is doomsday fortress standard

9
00:00:38,390 --> 00:00:41,630
This group of residents who have been wreaking havoc for half a month can't even break through the door.

10
00:00:41,630 --> 00:00:45,670
Ask him for help, send him a way to survive, and also add layers of insurance to yourself
